    "title": "53rd Annual Helen Balloon Race & Festival Starts Thursday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dean Dyer ,\n13 hours ago (Helen)- The 53rd Annual Helen to the Atlantic Balloon Race & Festival is kicking off this week. The South’s oldest balloon event and the United States’ only long distance hot air balloon race will begin with a mass ascension of around 25 hot air balloons. Race competitors and local flyers will take to the sky at 7:00 am, Thursday. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
